BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.00 510.39 Tm (-) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 74.00 510.39 Tm (Assigning work to users) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.00 492.44 Tm (-) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 74.00 492.44 Tm (Tracking task progress and revision status) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.00 474.49 Tm (-) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 74.00 474.49 Tm (Scheduling teleconference meetings) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.00 456.54 Tm (-) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 74.00 456.54 Tm (Opening meeting rooms through TTCS) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.00 438.59 Tm (-) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 74.00 438.59 Tm (Recording meeting attendance automatically) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.00 420.64 Tm (-) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 74.00 420.64 Tm (Sending and receiving internal inbox messages) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.00 402.69 Tm (-) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 74.00 402.69 Tm (Managing user accounts and monitoring system activity) Tj ET
BT /F2 12 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.00 368.74 Tm (1.2 Importance of TTCS) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.00 340.74 Tm (TTCS is important because it keeps operational work in one place. In the current) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.00 324.79 Tm (implementation, it helps organizations:) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.00 296.84 Tm (-) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 74.00 296.84 Tm (Reduce scattered communication by keeping task and meeting messages inside the) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 74.00 280.89 Tm (TTCS inbox) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.00 262.94 Tm (-) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 74.00 262.94 Tm (Improve accountability through task status tracking and assignment records) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.00 244.99 Tm (-) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 74.00 244.99 Tm (Monitor participation through automatic meeting time-in and time-out logging) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.00 227.04 Tm (-) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 74.00 227.04 Tm (Support administrators with user management and system event monitoring) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.00 209.09 Tm (-) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 74.00 209.09 Tm (Preserve historical records through task archiving and inbox trash retention) Tj ET
