BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.00 258.69 Tm (`Can regular users create tasks?`) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.00 230.74 Tm (Yes. In the current build, regular users can create tasks from the task dashboard.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.00 202.79 Tm (`Can admins assign one task to multiple users?`) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.00 174.84 Tm (Yes. The admin task form supports multiple assignees.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.00 146.89 Tm (`How is attendance recorded?`) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.00 118.94 Tm (Attendance is recorded automatically when the meeting room is opened and exited) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.00 102.99 Tm (through TTCS.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.00 75.04 Tm (`Can deleted inbox conversations still be recovered?`) Tj ET
